  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7602.02 Emergency response provider",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7602.02 “Emergency response provider” means entry level to managerial level public servants, medical personnel, public health personnel, emergency medical service personnel, firefighters, police officers, public works/utility personnel, and all others engaged in the emergency response to incidents requiring a coordinated response.\n\nSource. #13256, eff 8-24-21",
